    "id": "controls_position",
    "label": "Controls position",
    "info": "“On the slides” places the arrows and counter in the bottom corner of the slider (about 150 × 44 px) and suits images. For slides with text, product cards or videos with their own controls at the bottom, choose “Below the slides”. “On the slides, mobile only” applies while the carousel is narrower than 750 px, so also in narrow columns on desktop.",
    "default": "below",
    "options": [
     {
      "value": "below",
      "label": "Below the slides"
     },
     {
      "value": "overlay",
      "label": "On the slides"
